 "words_heard": 286,
 "words": 290,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "One horn was higher than the rest",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It charged west, north, and south",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.88,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No animal could stand against its power",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It did as it pleased and grew great",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a male goat came from the west",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Crossing the earth without touching ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A conspicuous horn between its eyes",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It rushed at the ram in furious power",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.76,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The large horn is broken off",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Four horns grow toward the four winds of heaven",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.95,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of one comes a small horn",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.87,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Growing exceedingly great toward the south",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It reaches the host of heaven",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.77,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Throwing stars down to the earth to be trampled",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "It sets itself up against the Prince",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.84,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Taking away the daily sacrifice",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Truth is flung to the ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.72,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Whatever it does, it prospered",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I heard a holy one speaking",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Asking how long this desolation will last",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The large horn is broken off",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.78,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Four horns grow toward the four winds of heaven",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.43,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Out of one comes a small horn",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Growing exceedingly great toward the south",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Gabriel explains the vision to me",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The ram represents Media and Persia",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The goat is the king of Greece",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The large horn is the first king",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.74,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Four kingdoms will arise from his nation",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But they will not have his power",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.52,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A fierce-looking king will arise",
